### 2. READ - Get all movies
GET https://movie-crud-6reh4n36s-maneesha-cse.vercel.app/api/v1/movies

###

### 3. READ - Get movie by ID
### Replace MOVIE_ID with the ID returned by CREATE
GET https://movie-crud-6reh4n36s-maneesha-cse.vercel.app/api/v1/movies/6afc36ee009cfcc4ebd87070

###

### 4. UPDATE - Update movie by ID
### Replace MOVIE_ID with the same ID returned by CREATE
