Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Baahubali 2",
  "director": "S.S. Rajamouli",
  "category": "Action Drama",
  "year": 2017
}

###

### 5. DELETE - Delete movie by ID
### Replace MOVIE_ID with the same ID returned by CREATE
